  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5017.04 Postponement of Display. The fire chief, police chief, or the commissioner shall order postponement of the display for any violation of these rules until such time as the violation shall have been corrected.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at Chapter Heading for Saf-C 5000) #6055, eff 7-1-95, EXPIRED: 7-1-03\n\nNew. #8117, INTERIM, eff 7-14-04, EXPIRED: 1-10-05\n\nNew. #8261, eff 1-21-05; ss by #9765-A, eff 8-2-10; ss by #12124, eff 3-6-17",
